    "explanation": "Tracer does well with Heroes who have strong waveclear, who can also deal area damage over time. Malfurion is a good pick for Tracer. He can heal her from a long distance due to how Regrowth works. Anduin is also good with her, because with her high mobility, Tracer can easily make Lightbomb hit the opposing backline."
