    "explanation": "Tracer is threatened by Heroes who have Abilities that can target her directly, such as Poly Bomb or Taunt. Her survival depends on mobility; she dies very quickly when she cannot avoid damage. This makes her vulnerable against Heroes with powerful ranged Basic Attacks, and Heroes who can disable her with single target crowdcontrol that prevents Recall from being cast."
